# GTS door, no Nintendo WFC login.
#
# The receptionist is at (7, 3) facing south. Standing on the tile in
# front of her and talking is how a player starts a Global Trade. With
# no DWC profile the script still walks through the door, then
# TryStartGTSApp returns 0 and the player is walked back out. That is
# the console's refusal, not a fabricated comms reply.

name GTSER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 20481
money 3000
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_TURTWIG
flag FLAG_TALKED_TO_GLOBAL_TERMINAL_1F_RECEPTIONIST_GTS
party SPECIES_TURTWIG 15 ITEM_NONE
party SPECIES_STARLY 12 ITEM_NONE
map MAP_HEADER_GLOBAL_TERMINAL_1F 7 4 FACE_UP
